<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ARIZONA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM ARIZONA.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Arizona 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$328,000 Arizona tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>8-Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 2-6 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat Sandon Stolle (Australia) 6-4 5-7</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Jerome Golmard (France) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6) 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Bryan Shelton (U.S.) 6-4</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) 0-6</p>
<p>6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
